  "title": "Your Authorization Rate Is a Vanity Metric: What That 91% Is Actually Hiding",
  "summary": "Your payments dashboard says your authorization rate is 91%. That looks healthy. But buried inside that number are soft declines that could be retried, issuer fraud flags triggered by your own billing patterns, and a “do not honor” code that tells you absolutely nothing. That 91% isn’t a diagnosis. It’s a sedative.",
